xtNodeIds":[150160104]},{"nodeId":150160104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":403595138,"text":"ただ、ラゾーリおばちゃんの工房は完全に閉鎖されて、作りかけの「燃晶名刻」は処分されることになったよ。","nextNodeIds":[150160105]},{"nodeId":150160105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":3436370466,"text":"もう完成してる「燃晶名刻」については、ウチが対応することになったけど。はぁ、またメンドーな仕事が増えちった…","nextNodeIds":[150160106]},{"nodeId":150160106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":2444163786,"text":"とにかく、おばちゃんの「古名」に問題が生じなかったのは不幸中の幸いだよ。じゃなきゃ、今頃ヤバイことになってただろうし…","nextNodeIds":[150160107]},{"nodeId":150160107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":138691450,"text":"あっ、古名といえば、いいニュースもあんだ。「燃晶名刻」に取り込まれた記憶は元に戻せるんだって。","nextNodeIds":[150160108]},{"nodeId":150160108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":832796730,"text":"すべての「燃晶名刻」の機能が停止したら、記憶は元の道を辿って持ち主のところに戻るみたい。","nextNodeIds":[150160109,150160110]},{"nodeId":150160109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3519586362,"text":"みんなのニエガに関する記憶も…","nextNodeIds":[150160111]},{"nodeId":150160111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":1248940386,"text":"そゆこと。でも今になって思うとさ…おばちゃんはニエガを取り戻そうとして、みんなにその存在を忘れさせたんだよね。","nextNodeIds":[150160112]},{"nodeId":150160112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":2559993658,"text":"けど本当にいなくなった今、こうして思い出せるようになるなんて…ほんと、めちゃくちゃ。","nextNodeIds":[150160113]},{"nodeId":150160113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":661398586,"text":"ニペカの調子はどう？","nextNodeIds":[150160114]},{"nodeId":150160114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":3632642946,"text":"今はウチの工房で休んでるよ。部族の人にも相談して、出自を調べてもらってる。","nextNodeIds":[150160115]},{"nodeId":150160115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":2384350370,"text":"その結果が出るまで時間が掛かるだろうし、しばらくはあの子の世話をしながら、鍛造の技術でも教えよっかなって思ってる。","nextNodeIds":[150160116]},{"nodeId":150160116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":87848618,"text":"ま、どれも今後の話だけどね。今はゆっくり眠らせてあげないと。","nextNodeIds":[150160117]},{"nodeId":150160117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":3684535730,"text":"睡眠を十分に取ることこそ、面倒事を片付ける上で一番大切だからね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":150160110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":418052338,"text":"一緒に戻るってこと？","nextNodeIds":[150160111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1501601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1501601","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1095"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1501601],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[115016],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2839365046,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"1095":[1120]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NATLAN_TRIBAL","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":2068,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue